opular bathing establishment. Anna is unexpectedly crowned “Most Beautiful Mother”, unwittingly stirring the violent jealousy of her husband. From then on, chaos strikes the family and for Anna, Bruno and his sister Valeria, it is the start of an adventure that will only end thirty years later."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/10MQjSuqDBNiPtxxO3zBqERw0q3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1HiZLxlZdLNviwXdBGe6L77fIWm.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":36940,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/10MQjSuqDBNiPtxxO3zBqERw0q3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/10MQjSuqDBNiPtxxO3zBqERw0q3.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/10MQjSuqDBNiPtxxO3zBqERw0q3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/10MQjSuqDBNiPtxxO3zBqERw0q3.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iITG3dL1Yzv1OH1oFbAk0WW4GGO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iITG3dL1Yzv1OH1oFbAk0WW4GGO.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AmualwnJJBmAbRb6k9qaqFWMgqP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AmualwnJJBmAbRb6k9qaqFWMgqP.jpg","language":"it","width":1002,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7h4BbIGigxaECJFQWEaQ9ih3INp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7h4BbIGigxaECJFQWEaQ9ih3INp.jpg","language":"en","width":1200,"height":1781},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7h4BbIGigxaECJFQWEaQ9ih3INp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7h4B